# links, citations and publication history keep resolving. The old titles survive as
# provenance only - they are not the current public identity of the book.
/books/it-shouldnt-be-this-hard/*  /books/free-2b-me/  301!
/books/enough/                     /books/free-2b-me/  301
/enough/*                          /books/free-2b-me/  301!

# Preserve historical external links while titles are migrated.
/designed-for-more/*  /books/  301

# /systems-change/ became /for-organisations/. The page was framed as a critique of
# sector failure; it is now an offer to organisations. The old path keeps resolving.
/systems-change/*                  /for-organisations/  301!
